card.statement:
(<<cite:FKW92>>) Let $k$ be an admissible number for $\affg$, $q\in \N$ the denominator of $k$. Suppose that $(r^{\vee},q)=1$ and $q\geq h$. We have a bijection

\begin{align*}
\begin{array}{ccc}
(\widehat{P}^{p-h^{\vee}}_+ \times \widehat{P}_+^{\vee,q-h})/\eW_+ & \isomap & [\overline{Pr}_k^{\mathbb{O}_{prin}}],\\
\quad [(\lam,\mu)]& \mapsto  &[\bar \lam-\frac{p}{q}(\bar \mu+\rho^{\vee} ) ],
\end{array}
\end{align*}

where $\eW_+$ acts diagonally on $\widehat{P}^{p-h^{\vee}}_+ \times {}^L\widehat{P}_+^{q-h}$.
